@NutritionService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### 1. Get current nutrition preference (unconfigured returns prompt)
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Set nutrition goal to Maintain (FIT-162)
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Maintain"
}

###

### 3. Get current nutrition preference after setting (FIT-163)
GET {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Update nutrition goal to GradualLoss
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "GradualLoss"
}

###

### 5. Update nutrition goal to GradualGain
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "GradualGain"
}

###

### 6. Test Validation - Invalid Goal
PUT {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": 999
}

###

### 7. Test POST alias endpoint
POST {{NutritionService_HostAddress}}/api/nutrition/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal": "Maintain"
}

###
